  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI - Faye - Warka Payments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia is the worlds fastest growing economy, but one of its biggest obstacles is the lack of information on business transactions. Minase has developed a cash register machine which he will distribute for free which can also be used as bank processing machines and mobile banking agents. This will simplify transaction follow up, process bankcards and mobile money, collect expenses online, declare and pay taxes online creating a more transparent and robust economy.</narrative>
  </description>
